  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tonga Police Development Programme - bilateral programme 2021 -2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Tonga-New&#xa0;Zealand Policing Programme (&lt;strong&gt;TNZPP&lt;/strong&gt;) will strengthen the policing partnership between Tonga and New&#xa0;Zealand by ensuring the investment in infrastructure and capability development delivered under the concluded Tonga Police Development Programme is enhanced and embedded.
Tonga Police has identified four keys pillars for New&#xa0;Zealand Police to support. These key pillars are:&lt;ul&gt;  &lt;li&gt;People Development&lt;/li&gt;  &lt;li&gt;Information Management&lt;/li&gt;  &lt;li&gt;Corporate Development&lt;/li&gt;  &lt;li&gt;Intelligence and Investigations&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
